  codex: "- **Report findings and the verdict to the orchestrator that spawned you** — your structured final report carries every `FINDING:` and the `VERDICT:`. When the orchestrator relays a peer evaluator's finding for cross-evaluator critique, return your `CRITIQUE:` as part of your report.\n",
