  codex: "- **Model-generated-code bias** — Which of these is this change especially exposed to: multi-file impact blindness, default-value bias, type-safety escape hatches (`as X`, forced casts, `any`), insecure defaults, copy-paste mutation, dead writes, async and ordering hazards?\n",
