  opencode: "Run the code where possible. On Deep, your peer exercises the same worktree concurrently: before filing a nondeterminism, flake, or \"the gate disagrees with itself\" finding, rule out a peer's transient edit or run (mtimes, `git status`, the orchestrator's relay of its last finding). A witness that holds a shared resource for long (lock, port, service, load run) blocks your peer and the orchestrator's gate — run it last or tell the orchestrator first.\n",
